# Headers for the static assets (Workers static assets read this file from dist/ and don't serve it). Every rule that
# matches a path applies, and a header set twice is joined, so a rule that replaces one has to detach it first.

# Every file: revalidate, since HTML, icons, OG images and the CV keep their names across deploys. Basic security
# headers. No CSP yet.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

# Astro's build output, .glb models and .woff2 fonts included: the names carry a content hash, so they never change
# in place.
/_astro/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
